Speech and cleanup models
Models are downloaded at runtime and are NOT bundled; each keeps its own license, shown in the app's model list. The remaining models use the following licenses:
- MIT
- Apache-2.0
- CC-BY-4.0
- Other (handy-computer/Fun-ASR-MLT-Nano-2512-gguf, handy-computer/Fun-ASR-Nano-2512-gguf): terms are available in the model card.

Models under non-commercial or uncleared licenses are not offered (refer to LEGAL_HOLD_IDS in src-tauri/src/catalog/mod.rs).
